# The vampire's garden (4fjarvamp), then a JARDIM win: WinExec at the scene start,
# JARDIM's WM_CREATE at 1500, jardim-alone-win.input's presses shifted by 1500, the win at
# 81370. In the Original JARDIM posts 0x40c on every message and never reads NOITE's
# ack, which 4fjarvamp sends for every 0x40c: the two bounce messages for the whole game
# (the port's clock runs on, as Windows'), the 8-message queues stay full and JARDIM's
# result is lost; NOITE then finds the window gone and reports itself a loss with no
# score: game over (6fsaida). BUGS.md J7. With the fixes NOITE gets the win (+14620,
# won 14620) and plays the second ending (6fsai2).
#
#   zig-out/bin/noite --headless --scene 4fjarvamp --ms 84000 --input tools/play/jardim-4fjarvamp-win.input
#   zig-out/bin/noite --headless --scene 4fjarvamp --ms 84000 --fix all --input tools/play/jardim-4fjarvamp-win.input
